		<!-- BOOTSTRAP: one-shot tier marker initialization       -->
		<!-- Fires once per world (UniqueEvent). Conditions only  -->
		<!-- reference the long-existing Points counters - never  -->
		<!-- Tier - because a condition referencing a never-written -->
		<!-- counter always fails (GetVariable success flag).     -->
		<!-- =================================================== -->
